<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en"><head><link href="assets/tailwind.css" rel="stylesheet"/><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/><title>Security &amp; Trust | ZKTeco WFM</title><meta content="Explore ZKTeco WFM’s approach to product security, data protection, assurance and security review." name="description"/><link href="/assets/site-enhancements.css?v=keytitles-v126" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/privacy.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="assets/layout-standard-v114.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://zktecowfm.com/security-trust" /></head><body class="zk-page"><Header /><main><section class="zk-hero"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-eyebrow">SECURITY &amp; TRUST</div><h1>Trust Should Be Built In.</h1><p>Explore ZKTeco WFM’s approach to product security, data protection, assurance and security review.</p></div></section><section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">ENTERPRISE TRUST</div><h2>Make Security Easy to Evaluate.</h2><p>Clear security, data-protection and assurance information for enterprise customers and partners.</p></div><div class="zk-grid-4"><article class="zk-card"><h3>Product Security</h3><p>Security considerations across workforce endpoints, applications, cloud services and integrations.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Data Security</h3><p>Controls and practices designed to protect workforce data throughout collection, transmission and processing.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Assurance &amp; Reports</h3><p>Relevant reports, assessments and supporting documentation can be made available through the appropriate review process.</p></article><article class="zk-card"><h3>Incident Response</h3><p>Defined processes for identifying, managing, escalating and communicating security events.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section alt"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">DRATA TRUST CENTER</div><h2>Security Evidence. One Place.</h2><p>A Drata-powered Trust Center will centralize security and compliance information for due diligence.</p></div><div class="zk-card" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div><div class="zk-tag">COMING SOON</div><h3>ZKTeco WFM Trust Center</h3><p>The Trust Center will provide a controlled destination for security information, reports, policies, questionnaires and other approved assurance materials.</p><span class="zk-disabled-domain">trust.zktecowfm.com</span></div><button aria-disabled="true" class="zk-btn disabled" disabled="">Trust Center — Coming Soon</button></div></div></section>
<section class="zk-section"><div class="zk-wrap"><div class="zk-section-head"><div class="zk-eyebrow">SECURITY REVIEW</div><h2>Need Security Information Now?</h2><p>We can route IT, security, privacy, procurement and legal requests to the right resource.</p></div><div class="zk-actions"><a class="zk-btn primary" href="contact">Request Security Information</a><a class="zk-btn secondary" href="privacy">Review Privacy Information</a></div><div class="zk-notice" style="margin-top:24px">Security and compliance statements are subject to the applicable product, service, environment and contractual scope. Customers should review the documentation applicable to their deployment.</div></div></section></main><Footer /><script is:inline src="assets/privacy.js"></script></body></html>